# Code Readability 

**Date**: 08-09-2026

**While making pipelines , things to keep in mind:**
1. Always put credentials in .env file or make them hash code.
2. Never put .env file to github.
3. Make the code reusable, write it in a way so that we can add other functionalities in code with just very few changes.
4. Use the function names, variable names relevant to your work.
5. When writing a code as a part of learning or college project work , think from a production point of view. 
